        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86566, Clear Crystal Windsor Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Windsor Crystal Cabinet Knob is a beautiful, rectangular shape that adds a modern flair to the traditional crystal material. Emtek's Windsor Cabinet Knob is made from clear crystal with a brass base that is available in a huge array of finish color options. The Clear Crystal Windsor Knob comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-CK-176-specifications.gif?v=1704354739\" width=\"469\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86566 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Windsor Cabinet Drawer Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Crystal with Brass Stem</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
